    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "On instructions, the learned Government Advocate (Crl. Side) appearing for the respondent police submitted that after completion of investigation in FIR No.101 of 2016, the respondent filed final report and the same has been taken cognizance in C.C.No.711 of 2023 on the file of the learned XI Metropolitan Magistrate, Saidapet, in which, the petitioner is arrayed as second accused.\n3. Considering the above submissions, the prayer for discharge the petitioner's name in FIR does not arise and the Writ Petition stands dismissed.",
